<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 441)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed: a clip's remembered input space could be silently overwritten during playlist playback</b> — an EXR sequence could drift to a video transform as a compare looped. The per-format memory now records your explicit picks only; if a format looks wrong, pick its space once and it sticks again.</li>
<li><b>Marks align in side-by-side and stacked compares</b>: each picture shows its own marks, and drawing targets the picture under your cursor.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
