<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 439)</h2>
<p><b>Compare sides now decode as themselves.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Comparing a Rec.709 QuickTime against an ACEScg EXR? Each side gets its own input transform — the B side uses its declared space, or the remembered default for <b>its</b> kind of file, never A's transform by accident. Set B's space from the input menu with the working side on B.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
